				</tr>
							<tr>
					<td class="comment" colspan="2">
					ハサミのグラデーションが美しい。腹の墨入れもいい出来。</td>
				</tr>
							<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/akategani008.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/akategani008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/REVOGEO/002Akategani/img/akategani008.jpg" --></a></td>
					<td>
					<a href="img/akategani007.jpg">
